<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-7967] DataRegionMetrics#totalAllocatedPages is invalid if metrics were enabled at runtime</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7967</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;totalAllocatedPages&lt;/tt&gt; is updated during runtime via callback. When metrics are enabled at runtime, some pages may be already allocated, thus the metric shows invalid value.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
