                            <comment id="16526567" author="cyberdemon" created="Thu, 28 Jun 2018 17:15:38 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=sergey-chugunov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;sergey-chugunov&quot;&gt;sergey-chugunov&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=agoncharuk&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;agoncharuk&quot;&gt;agoncharuk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ivan.glukos&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ivan.glukos&quot;&gt;ivan.glukos&lt;/a&gt;, review my patch, please!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16530092" author="agoncharuk" created="Mon, 2 Jul 2018 15:42:30 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=cyberdemon&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;cyberdemon&quot;&gt;cyberdemon&lt;/a&gt;, can you please pull up master and re-run TC, I have merge conflicts.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16530129" author="cyberdemon" created="Mon, 2 Jul 2018 16:18:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=agoncharuk&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;agoncharuk&quot;&gt;agoncharuk&lt;/a&gt;, done.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16548224" author="agura" created="Wed, 18 Jul 2018 18:28:01 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=cyberdemon&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;cyberdemon&quot;&gt;cyberdemon&lt;/a&gt; I&apos;ve looked to your change and I believe it is very complex solution for this issue. I believe that the simplest way to solve problem is just always count allocated pages. Just ignore &lt;tt&gt;metricsEnabled&lt;/tt&gt; flag.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16549457" author="cyberdemon" created="Thu, 19 Jul 2018 15:58:38 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=agura&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;agura&quot;&gt;agura&lt;/a&gt;, I modified my solution with your proposal so one&#160;it is more simple now, review my new patch, please.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16587895" author="agura" created="Tue, 21 Aug 2018 19:23:50 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=cyberdemon&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;cyberdemon&quot;&gt;cyberdemon&lt;/a&gt; Latest changes isn&apos;t obvious (some manipulations with +/- 1 and etc). Could you please just ignore metricEnabled flag for this particular metric? It seems that it is most easy way.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16589126" author="cyberdemon" created="Wed, 22 Aug 2018 17:08:44 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=agura&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;agura&quot;&gt;agura&lt;/a&gt; While working on this task, I discovered several problems that I also fixed in this context:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Wrong points of metric update at PageMemoryNoStoreImpl class;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;File header size was added to value of &apos;allocated&apos; field of FilePageStore class, but substracted at usages of that value;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Incorrect calculation of totalPersistenceSize variable value at the checkMetricsConsistency method of IgnitePdsDataRegionMetricsTest class;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Every-time creation of no-op implementation of&#160;AllocatedPageTracker interface instead usage of singleton;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;ClusterNodeMetricsSelfTest and DataRegionMetricsSelfTest was fixed according to new metric behaviour.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="16593545" author="agura" created="Mon, 27 Aug 2018 11:44:36 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=cyberdemon&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;cyberdemon&quot;&gt;cyberdemon&lt;/a&gt; LGTM. Merged to master branch. Thanks for contribution!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
